Package: doumi
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libgtk-4-1 (>= 4.12), libadwaita-1-0 (>= 1.6), libc6 (>= 2.34)
Recommends: systemd
Maintainer: Doumi Project <doumi@example.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/doumi/doumi
Description: Intelligent file organizer for Linux
 Doumi is an intelligent file organization tool that watches folders
 and applies user-defined rules to automatically sort, rename, and
 manage files.
 .
 Features:
  - Rule-based file matching (extension, name, date, size, kind, etc.)
  - Real-time filesystem watching via inotify
  - Scheduled rule execution via cron expressions
  - Safety checks: skip system dirs, project roots, symlinks to external
  - Dry-run mode to preview actions before committing
  - GTK4 GUI for visual rule editing (hazel-like interface)
  - CLI for scripting and headless use
  - Systemd user service for background daemon
  - Action logging and preview
